BHAYE TERA CHEHLUM KARNE DUKHYA ZAINAB AAYE HAI<br>
SATH MEIN APNE SHANON PAR DAGHE RASAN KE LAYE HAI<br>
<br>
Qaid huwe dar dar bhi phire, darbaar mein zalim ke bhi gaye<br>
Ummat ne nana ki hum par, kaise qayamat dhaye hai<br>
<br>
Sar se mere chadar bhi chini, durre bhi lagaye zalim ne<br>
Koi na tha jo ye keh deta, Sarwar ki maajaye hai<br>
<br>
Karbo bala se sham talak, har gaam pe thi wo joor-o-jafa<br>
Kaise kahun aye bhaye Zainab, kya kya zulm uthaye hai<br>
<br>
Lab pe tumhare aye bhayya, jis waqt rakhi zulm ne chadi<br>
Dekh ke us manzar ko Sakina, der talak tharrayi hai<br>
<br>
Balwe mein be maqna-o-chadar, sar ko jhukaye mai thi khadi<br>
Yaad mujhe Abbas-e-jari ki, har lamha tardpaye hai<br>

